  "text": "neatlogs is how we looked into these incidents and checked how each one was resolved. Each run is one trace, with every probe and model call behind it. On the Crustdata run, the trace showed a disputed claim's prediction, logged with its hash before the call, and an inconclusive result. So Notary abstained, and no payment can depend on that claim. Two more mismatches stay open and uncertified, so the Guard blocks them. On the Dodo run, the trace showed the Adversary narrowing four beliefs, like wallet credits in minor units only for US dollars, so Notary certified only that narrower scope.",
